"nalbuphine":{"s":"a3221c05-5822-4ab8-b589-0e3939b91a68","d":"2025-03-26","b":"Nalbuphine Hydrochloride Injection (nalbuphine hydrochloride)","m":"Somerset Therapeutics, LLC","r":"INTRAVENOUS; INTRAMUSCULAR; SUBCUTANEOUS","q":[["Adult","The usual recommended adult dose is 10 mg for a 70 kg individual administered subcutaneously, intramuscularly, or intravenously; this dose may be repeated every 3 to 6 hours as necessary."],["Maximum","In nontolerant individuals, the recommended single maximum dose is 20 mg with a maximum total daily dose of 160 mg."]],"nl":0},
